"2\"},{\"adid\":\"\",\"brief\":\"本片通过中国新一代超级计算机“曙光8000”的科技攻坚，讲述中国超算从受制于人到实现自主创新的奋进历程。展现“曙光8000”作为自主可控的国家算力底座，如何成为驱动科学研究、产业升级和人工智能发展的核心引擎，并赋能中国迈向“数字强国”的新纪元，揭示超级工程背后的技术突破、科学价值与人文光辉。\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\",\"cornerStrRb\":\"\",\"endTime\":0,\"epgChnlChar\":\"\",\"epgDarkDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgDarkHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgId\":0,\"epgName\":\"\",\"epgType\":\"\",\"fc\":\"\",\"homologous\":0,\"hoverText\":\"\",\"img1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/vms/standard/img/2026/9/24/VSETp5ZLgIuFzqAvu1aEyFFB260924.jpg?q=75\",\"img2\":\"\",\"img3\":\"\",\"imgRGB\":\"#856553\",\"isTop\":0,\"is_media_account\":0,\"itemId\":\"VSET1k36nvgeoqhnacpo9pfur8\",\"itemUrl\":\"\",\"jumpUrl\":\"cntvcbox%3A%2F%2Fapp.cntv.cn%2FvideoSet%3Fplayid%3D%26itemId%3DVSET1k36nvgeoqhnacpo9pfur8%26title%3D%25E3%2580%258A%25E8%25B6%2585%25E7%25BA%25A7%25E5%25B7%25A5%25E7%25A8%258B%25E3%2580%258B%26vipFlag%3D0\",\"media_account_id\":\"\",\"mid\":\"\",\"playid\":\"\",\"price\":\"\",\"recordNumber\":0,\"sc\":\"\",\"showStyle\":\"0\",\"skinColor\":\"\",\"source\":\"曙光8000\",\"startTime\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"timeLineDate\":0,\"title\":\"《超级工程》\",\"trackId\":2579641,\"videoLength\":\"\",\"videoSetId\":\"\",\"vip_flag\":0,\"vsetType\":\"\",\"vtype\":\"2\"},{\"adid\":\"\",\"brief\":\"该片借助文物、手艺、艺术等能反映人文思想的器物或技艺，每集一个知识点，从问题出发，探寻独属于中国的风格，并向人们介绍那些“中国 STYLE”——我们曾经的生活，我们正在进行的生活。\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\",\"cornerStrRb\":\"\",\"endTime\":0,\"epgChnlChar\":\"\",\"epgDarkDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgDarkHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgId\":0,\"epgName\":\"\",\"epgType\":\"\",\"fc\":\"\",\"homologous\":0,\"hoverText\":\"\",\"img1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/vms/image/94a94a8448273dffac4de428240fb6e2.jpg?q=75\",\"img2\":\"\",\"img3\":\"\",\"imgRGB\":\"#856553\",\"isTop\":0,\"is_media_account\":0,\"itemId\":\"VSET1k3osjrip7qsq51ucvq7m3\",\"itemUrl\":\"\",\"jumpUrl\":\"cntvcbox%3A%2F%2Fapp.cntv.cn%2FvideoSet%3Fplayid%3D%26itemId%3DVSET1k3osjrip7qsq51ucvq7m3%26title%3D%25E3%2580%258A%25E5%25BC%2580%25E5%25A7%258B%25E6%258F%2590%25E9%2597%25AE%25E5%2590%25A7%25E3%2580%258B%26vipFlag%3D0\",\"media_account_id\":\"\",\"mid\":\"\",\"playid\":\"\",\"price\":\"\",\"recordNumber\":0,\"sc\":\"\",\"showStyle\":\"\",\"skinColor\":\"\",\"source\":\"AI提问\",\"startTime\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"timeLineDate\":0,\"title\":\"《开始提问吧》\",\"trackId\":2579640,\"videoLength\":\"\",\"videoSetId\":\"\",\"vip_flag\":0,\"vsetType\":\"\",\"vtype\":\"2\"},{\"adid\":\"\",\"brief\":\"该片立足八千年华夏根脉,以伏羲文化为中华文明早期原点展开叙事。节目依托史前考古遗址实证、多民族活态传承纪实与东方哲学思辨三重维度，梳理伏羲文化从西北辐射全域、融汇成多元一体中华文明的发展脉络，彰显民族文化自信、凝聚民族精神力量。\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\",\"cornerStrRb\":\"\",\"endTime\":0,\"epgChnlChar\":\"\",\"epgDarkDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgDarkHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgId\":0,\"epgName\":\"\",\"epgType\":\"\",\"fc\":\"\",\"homologous\":0,\"hoverText\":\"\",\"img1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/vms/image/be119436e8b1065ad5f380dfe80a6245.jpg?q=75\",\"img2\":\"\",\"img3\":\"\",\"imgRGB\":\"#856553\",\"isTop\":0,\"is_media_account\":0,\"itemId\":\"VSET1k36nvm1ab4u2aa98f5dme\",\"itemUrl\":\"\",\"jumpUrl\":\"cntvcbox%3A%2F%2Fapp.cntv.cn%2FvideoSet%3Fplayid%3D%26itemId%3DVSET1k36nvm1ab4u2aa98f5dme%26title%3D%25E3%2580%258A%25E4%25BC%258F%25E7%25BE%25B2%25E3%2580%258B%26vipFlag%3D0\",\"media_account_id\":\"\",\"mid\":\"\",\"playid\":\"\",\"price\":\"\",\"recordNumber\":0,\"sc\":\"\",\"showStyle\":\"\",\"skinColor\":\"\",\"source\":\"伏羲\",\"startTime\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"timeLineDate\":0,\"title\":\"《伏羲》\",\"trackId\":2579639,\"videoLength\":\"\",\"videoSetId\":\"\",\"vip_flag\":0,\"vsetType\":\"\",\"vtype\":\"2\"},{\"adid\":\"\",\"brief\":\"本片聚焦碳元素，跟随澳大利亚科学家乔丹·阮探索全球顶尖科研项目，讲述来自不同国家、不同领域与碳元素相关的科研故事，从碳与生命、碳与气候、碳与未来三个维度，带领观众理解碳的多元身份，呈现立体、复杂的碳基世界，向全球观众传递“人类命运共同体”理念。\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\",\"cornerStrRb\":\"\",\"endTime\":0,\"epgChnlChar\":\"\",\"epgDarkDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgDarkHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgId\":0,\"epgName\":\"\",\"epgType\":\"\",\"fc\":\"\",\"homologous\":0,\"hoverText\":\"\",\"img1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/vms/image/a18e90ff32e4bf82de9fd9cadd7bd3ae.jpg?q=75\",\"img2\":\"\",\"img3\":\"\",\"imgRGB\":\"#856553\",\"isTop\":0,\"is_media_account\":0,\"itemId\":\"VSET1k31jo8t9j9tq6dk7c16df\",\"itemUrl\":\"\",\"jumpUrl\":\"cntvcbox%3A%2F%2Fapp.cntv.cn%2FvideoSet%3Fplayid%3D%26itemId%3DVSET1k31jo8t9j9tq6dk7c16df%26title%3D%25E3%2580%258A%25E6%2588%2591%25E4%25BB%25AC%25E7%259A%2584%25E7%25A2%25B3%25E6%2597%25B6%25E4%25BB%25A3%25E3%2580%258B%26vipFlag%3D0\",\"media_account_id\":\"\",\"mid\":\"\",\"playid\":\"\",\"price\":\"\",\"recordNumber\":0,\"sc\":\"\",\"showStyle\":\"\",\"skinColor\":\"\",\"source\":\"碳元素\",\"startTime\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"timeLineDate\":0,\"title\":\"《我们的碳时代》\",\"trackId\":2578604,\"videoLength\":\"\",\"videoSetId\":\"\",\"vip_flag\":0,\"vsetType\":\"\",\"vtype\":\"2\"},{\"adid\":\"\",\"brief\":\"本片以牙科医学为切入点，以现实案例故事、牙科医学发展、历史故事、增强现实动画等为内容，从科学、历史、人文等维度认识牙齿，传达科学健康的护牙观念。\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\",\"cornerStrRb\":\"\",\"endTime\":0,\"epgChnlChar\":\"\",\"epgDarkDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgDarkHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgId\":0,\"epgName\":\"\",\"epgType\":\"\",\"fc\":\"\",\"homologous\":0,\"hoverText\":\"\",\"img1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/vms/image/8975aaf43cd45101fb754ff2c6803951.jpg?q=75\",\"img2\":\"\",\"img3\":\"\",\"imgRGB\":\"#856553\",\"isTop\":0,\"is_media_account\":0,\"itemId\":\"VSET1k2n839e7qb1u89a3m9d4b\",\"itemUrl\":\"\",\"jumpUrl\":\"cntvcbox%3A%2F%2Fapp.cntv.cn%2FvideoSet%3Fplayid%3D%26itemId%3DVSET1k2n839e7qb1u89a3m9d4b%26title%3D%25E3%2580%258A%25E4%25BB%258E%25E2%2580%259C%25E9%25BD%25BF%25E2%2580%259D%25E5%2581%25A5%25E5%25BA%25B7%25E3%2580%258B%26vipFlag%3D0\",\"media_account_id\":\"\",\"mid\":\"\",\"playid\":\"\",\"price\":\"\",\"recordNumber\":0,\"sc\":\"\",\"showStyle\":\"\",\"skinColor\":\"\",\"source\":\"牙科\",\"startTime\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"timeLineDate\":0,\"title\":\"《从“齿”健康》\",\"trackId\":2578603,\"videoLength\":\"\",\"videoSetId\":\"\",\"vip_flag\":0,\"vsetType\":\"\",\"vtype\":\"2\"},{\"adid\":\"\",\"brief\":\"该片以历史上著名的关隘为叙述本体，讲述围绕关隘发生的影响中国历史发展进程、在中华民族发展史上具有重大意义的历史事件和著名人物故事，挖掘关隘蕴含的历史文化价值，彰显中华民族的文化自信和家国情怀。\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\",\"cornerStrRb\":\"\",\"endTime\":0,\"epgChnlChar\":\"\",\"epgDarkDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgDarkHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgId\":0,\"epgName\":\"\",\"epgType\":\"\",\"fc\":\"\",\"homologous\":0,\"hoverText\":\"\",\"img1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/vms/image/89c76a6a724042bcfec61479cca0ab48.jpg?q=75\",\"img2\":\"\",\"img3\":\"\",\"imgRGB\":\"#856553\",\"isTop\":0,\"is_media_account\":0,\"itemId\":\"VSET1hvokhdfna5dfuh3tpgi83\",\"itemUrl\":\"\",\"jumpUrl\":\"cntvcbox%3A%2F%2Fapp.cntv.cn%2FvideoSet%3Fplayid%3D%26itemId%3DVSET1hvokhdfna5dfuh3tpgi83%26title%3D%25E3%2580%258A%25E5%25A4%25A9%25E4%25B8%258B%25E9%259B%2584%25E5%2585%25B3%25E3%2580%258B%26vipFlag%3D0\",\"media_account_id\":\"\",\"mid\":\"\",\"playid\":\"\",\"price\":\"\",\"recordNumber\":0,\"sc\":\"\",\"showStyle\":\"\",\"skinColor\":\"\",\"source\":\"关隘\",\"startTime\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"timeLineDate\":0,\"title\":\"《天下雄关》\",\"trackId\":2578112,\"videoLength\":\"\",\"videoSetId\":\"\",\"vip_flag\":0,\"vsetType\":\"\",\"vtype\":\"2\"},{\"adid\":\"\",\"brief\":\"本片用创新视角，采用医学+科学的融合方式，以“水”在人体八大系统中的循环、代谢以及其在各个系统（如消化系统、血液循环系统、泌尿系统等）中的关键作用为主线，全方位展现那些隐藏在细胞深处、流淌于血管之中、浸润着组织间隙的“水”所蕴含的巨大奥秘与力量，让观众深刻认识到“水”是生命活动的核心要素之一，维持人体“水”世界的平衡是保持健康的重要基础。\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\",\"cornerStrRb\":\"\",\"endTime\":0,\"epgChnlChar\":\"\",\"epgDarkDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgDarkHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgId\":0,\"epgName\":\"\",\"epgType\":\"\",\"fc\"