7/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n\t\t            </div>\r\n\t\t            <div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t                <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/19/VIDEWRc5YaBCKGaomkgECtKY261019.shtml?spm=C55853485115.PhO6T4rt8QwC.0.0\" target=\"_blank\">“澡堂律所”碰撞烟火气</a></h3>\r\n\t\t                <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/19/VIDEWRc5YaBCKGaomkgECtKY261019.shtml?spm=C55853485115.PhO6T4rt8QwC.0.0\" target=\"_blank\">“铁锅炖法理，澡堂涤正义”的融合碰撞，沉浸感受独树一帜的东北市井烟火气。</a></span>\r\n\t\t                <div class=\"label\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/09/24/VIDAjmJ7aTgfioo9JaXqzMVi260924.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">蒸蒸日上</a></div>\r\n\t\t            </div>\r\n\t\t        </div>\r\n\t\t    </div>\r\n\t\t</li>\r\n\t\t<li class=\"end2\">\r\n\t\t    <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n\t\t        <div class=\"common\">\r\n\t\t            <div class=\"img\">\r\n\t\t              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/19/VIDEkfPQdDn49YVC84bK8krl261019.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p2.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2022/12/26/1672031316755_107.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n\t\t            </div>\r\n\t\t            <div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t              <div class=\"title\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/19/VIDEkfPQdDn49YVC84bK8krl261019.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">传递正义的力量</a></div>\r\n\t\t              <div class=\"brief\">真实现场构建悬念故事</div>\r\n\t\t            </div>\r\n\t\t        </div>\r\n\t\t        <div class=\"hover\">\r\n\t\t            <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p2.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2022/12/26/1672031329906_487.jpg\" data-src=\"\">\r\n\t\t              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/19/VIDEkfPQdDn49YVC84bK8krl261019.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n\t\t            </div>\r\n\t\t            <div cl