          "content" : {
            "size" : 874,
            "text" : "{\"code\":200,\"msg\":\"Success\",\"data\":{\"ad\":1,\"brief\":\"近日，尼泊尔一侧突发泥石流，仅用7分钟便冲至西藏吉隆口岸。当地此前并无明显强降雨，专家初步判断，灾害可能由高位冰崩引发。它为何来得如此快、冲击力如此强？救援难在哪？\",\"column_id\":\"TOPC1565938154916720\",\"fc\":\"原创\",\"focus_date\":\"1787973752000\",\"guid\":\"52c1c9d90d144457b3f6f0338d70a2ef\",\"id\":\"VIDEbq2TSgKlXuAO8fFxcyfo260829\",\"image\":\"https://p3.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20260829/1787973681785009461.jpg?q=75\",\"keywords\":\"吉隆,尼泊尔,灾害\",\"length\":\"00:02:44\",\"mode\":0,\"pid\":\"\",\"sc\":\"\",\"seqNo\":0,\"subjectId\":\"\",\"tc\":\"\",\"templateType\":1,\"title\":\"7分钟形成致命冲击！吉隆跨境泥石流为何如此凶猛\",\"type\":\"0\",\"url\":\"\",\"vip_flag\":0,\"vip_platform_flag\":\"\",\"vsetid\":\"VSET100335053389\",\"pageview\":\"280.3万\"}}",
