59B%259B%25E6%25BA%25A2%26vipFlag%3D0\",\"media_account_id\":\"\",\"mid\":\"\",\"playid\":\"7b260495a78e469f80aa0393b329fcc0\",\"price\":\"\",\"recordNumber\":0,\"sc\":\"生活\",\"showStyle\":\"0\",\"skinColor\":\"\",\"source\":\"顺德 美食\",\"startTime\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"timeLineDate\":0,\"title\":\"姜花浸鱼片：鲜味香气 交织四溢\",\"trackId\":2464849,\"type\":0,\"videoLength\":\"00:01:00\",\"videoSetId\":\"\",\"vip_flag\":0,\"vsetType\":\"\",\"vtype\":\"1\"},{\"ad\":1,\"adid\":\"\",\"brief\":\"舂陵村位于湖北枣阳吴店镇，因刘秀点将起兵而闻名。近年来，舂陵村坚持规划引领，加强环境整治，彰显文化特色，依托自然风光、产业优势，找寻文化基因，讲好文创故事，实现文旅融合发展。\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\",\"cornerStrRb\":\"\",\"endTime\":0,\"epgChnlChar\":\"\",\"epgDarkDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgDarkHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgDiamondPic\":\"\",\"epgHorizontalPic\":\"\",\"epgId\":0,\"epgName\":\"\",\"epgType\":\"\",\"fc\":\"原创\",\"homologous\":0,\"hoverText\":\"\",\"img1\":\"https://p1.img.cctvpic.com/apple3g/www/upload/image/20240412/1712908573470018872.jpg?q=75\",\"img2\":\"\",\"img3\":\"\",\"imgRGB\":\"#856553\",\"isTop\":0,\"is_media_account\":0,\"itemId\":\"\",\"itemUrl\":\"\",\"jumpUrl\":\"cntvcbox%3A%2F%2Fapp.cntv.cn%2FsingleVideo%3Fplayid%3D9d8b8f0b50ff464cae13aab2d1e220d8%26title%3D%25E8%2588%2582%25E9%2599%25B5%25E6%259D%2591%25EF%25BC%259A%25E8%25BF%259C%25E8%25BF%2591%25E9%2597%25BB%25E5%2590%258D%25E7%259A%2584%25E6%2597%2585%25E6%25B8%25B8%25E6%259D%2591%26vipFlag%3D0\",\"media_account_id\":\"\",\"mid\":\"\",\"playid\":\"9d8b8f0b50ff464cae13aab2d1e220d8\",\"price\":\"\",\"recordNumber\":0,\"sc\":\"生活\",\"showStyle\":\"1\",\"skinColor\":\"\",\"source\":\"湖北\",\"startTime\":0,\"subTitle\":\"\",\"timeLineDate\":0,\"title\":\"舂陵村：远近闻名的旅游村\",\"trackId\":2464565,\"type\":0,\"videoLength\":\"00:01:00\",\"videoSetId\":\"\",\"vip_flag\":0,\"vsetType\":\"\",\"vtype\":\"1\"},{\"ad\":1,\"adid\":\"\",\"brief\":\"长沙火宫殿传统小吃是长沙地方风味小吃的龙头和代表，以八大传统小吃为主体，即油炸臭豆腐、姊妹团子、龙脂猪血、三角干子、煮馓子、红烧猪脚、荷兰粉、八宝果饭。八大传统小吃都有独特的制作工艺，别具一格，为市民游客所广泛认同和喜爱，并传承已久。\",\"cornerColour\":\"\",\"cornerStr\":\"\