                     </div>\r\n                      <div class=\"hover\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/9/29/1790662451492_115.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/19/VIDErDLlo9ZGqu69Gq34s1qP261019.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\">\r\n                              <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/19/VIDErDLlo9ZGqu69Gq34s1qP261019.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《征途》</a></h3>\r\n                              <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/19/VIDErDLlo9ZGqu69Gq34s1qP261019.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">带领观众感悟革命先辈坚定的理想信念与家国担当，读懂长征精神，缅怀革命先烈，汲取砥砺前行的精神力量。</a></span>\r\n                              <div class=\"label\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PNiTV80kXvVM.E2PQtIunpEaz.68#datacid=dsj&datafl=%E9%9D%A9%E5%91%BD&datadq=&fc=%E7%94%B5%E8%A7%86%E5%89%A7&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">革命</a></div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PNiTV80kXvVM.E2PQtIunpEaz.68#datacid=dsj&datafl=%E9%9D%A9%E5%91%BD&datadq=&fc=%E7%94%B5%E8%A7%86%E5%89%A7&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">革命</a></div>\r\n              </li>\r\n\t\t\t  <li>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"common\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2025/08/08/VIDEuWeuvLwn1Vy7ac60Rb5g250808.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p4.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2025/7/16/1752648277112_720.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2025/08/08/VIDEuWeuvLwn1Vy7ac60Rb5g250808.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《浴血荣光》</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"hover\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2025/7/16/1752648145748_541.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2025/08/08/VIDEuWeuvLwn1Vy7ac60Rb5g250808.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2025/08/08/VIDEuWeuvLwn1Vy7ac60Rb5g250808.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《浴血荣光》</a></h3>\r\n\t\t\t                  <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2025/08/08/VIDEuWeuvLwn1Vy7ac60Rb5g250808.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">聚焦1927年至1935年间中国共产党领导的革命武装，从南昌起义到遵义会议的热血奋斗历程。</a></span>\r\n\t\t\t                  <div class=\"label\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PNiTV80kXvVM.E2PQtIunpEaz.68#datacid=dsj&datafl=%E9%9D%A9%E5%91%BD&datadq=&fc=%E7%94%B5%E8%A7%86%E5%89%A7&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">革命</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t      </div>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PNiTV80kXvVM.E2PQtIunpEaz.68#datacid=dsj&datafl=%E9%9D%A9%E5%91%BD&datadq=&fc=%E7%94%B5%E8%A7%86%E5%89%A7&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">革命</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t  </li>\r\n\t\t\t  <li>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"common\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/10/VIDEuiCzqPXFqzyZ5Y7oDzsh261010.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p4.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/13/1791874486311_956.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/10/VIDEuiCzqPXFqzyZ5Y7oDzsh261010.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《蒸蒸日上》</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"hover\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/13/1791875587708_282.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/10/VIDEuiCzqPXFqzyZ5Y7oDzsh261010.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/10/VIDEuiCzqPXFqzyZ5Y7oDzsh261010.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《蒸蒸日上》</a></h3>\r\n\t\t\t                  <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/10/VIDEuiCzqPXFqzyZ5Y7oDzsh261010.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">聚焦普通人的民生纠纷，于嬉笑对白中辨析法理人情，描绘烟火人间里的法治百态。</a></span>\r\n\t\t\t                  <div class=\"label\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.P2qo7O8Q1Led.EEfEAhEnQFPl.66#datacid=dsj&datafl=%E9%83%BD%E5%B8%82&datadq=&fc=电视剧&datanf=&dataszm=\"target=\"_blank\">都市</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t      </div>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.P2qo7O8Q1Led.EEfEAhEnQFPl.66#datacid=dsj&datafl=%E9%83%BD%E5%B8%82&datadq=&fc=电视剧&datanf=&dataszm=\"target=\"_blank\">都市</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t  </li>\r\n\t\t\t  <li>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"common\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2010/12/11/VIDE1355684237988116.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p2.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2024/3/19/1710819528406_943.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2010/12/11/VIDE1355684237988116.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《医者仁心》</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"hover\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2024/1/8/1704686077603_98.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2010/12/11/VIDE1355684237988116.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2010/12/11/VIDE1355684237988116.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《医者仁心》</a></h3>\r\n\t\t\t                  <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2010/12/11/VIDE1355684237988116.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">一群曾经充满理想与献身精神的医生在冲突与对立中找到平衡点，重新找回“医者仁心”的职业信仰。</a></span>\r\n\t\t\t                  <div class=\"label\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.P9dhkRStLqPh.EYq0LGFLODJm.68#datacid=dsj&datafl=%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%AD&datadq=&fc=电视剧&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">家庭</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t      </div>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.P9dhkRStLqPh.EYq0LGFLODJm.68#datacid=dsj&datafl=%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%AD&datadq=&fc=电视剧&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">家庭</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t  </li>\r\n\t\t\t  <li>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"common\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2023/07/31/VIDE233CpGR89ppZEeEJrgJl230731.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2023/7/13/1689229289863_618.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2023/07/31/VIDE233CpGR89ppZEeEJrgJl230731.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《曾少年》</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"hover\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p2.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2023/7/13/1689229775753_27.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2023/07/31/VIDE233CpGR89ppZEeEJrgJl230731.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2023/07/31/VIDE233CpGR89ppZEeEJrgJl230731.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《曾少年》</a></h3>\r\n\t\t\t                  <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2023/07/31/VIDE233CpGR89ppZEeEJrgJl230731.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">讲述了围绕仗义执着的“胡同小爷”秦川和活泼开朗的少女谢乔展开的一系列青春成长故事。</a></span>\r\n\t\t\t                  <div class=\"label\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.ELqI6BbwTMR4.5#datacid=dsj&datafl=%E8%A8%80%E6%83%85&datadq=&fc=电视剧&datanf=&dataszm=\"target=\"_blank\">言情</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t      </div>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.ELqI6BbwTMR4.5#datacid=dsj&datafl=%E8%A8%80%E6%83%85&datadq=&fc=电视剧&datanf=&dataszm=\"target=\"_blank\">言情</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t  </li>\r\n\t\t\t  <li class=\"end3\">\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"common\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2023/04/22/VIDEOXQ5bWnwdCM5QJtrmt08230422.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p2.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2021/10/25/1635128272763_67.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2023/04/22/VIDEOXQ5bWnwdCM5QJtrmt08230422.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《暖阳之下》</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"hover\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p5.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2021/10/25/1635128601583_940.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2023/04/22/VIDEOXQ5bWnwdCM5QJtrmt08230422.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2023/04/22/VIDEOXQ5bWnwdCM5QJtrmt08230422.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《暖阳之下》</a></h3>\r\n\t\t\t                  <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2023/04/22/VIDEOXQ5bWnwdCM5QJtrmt08230422.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">主人公宋思凝与丈夫两人因为生二胎产生矛盾，但最终相互包容，共同创造出幸福美好的生活 ！</a></span>\r\n\t\t\t                  <div class=\"label\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.P2qo7O8Q1Led.EEfEAhEnQFPl.66#datacid=dsj&datafl=%E9%83%BD%E5%B8%82&datadq=&fc=电视剧&datanf=&dataszm=\"target=\"_blank\">都市</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t      </div>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.P2qo7O8Q1Led.EEfEAhEnQFPl.66#datacid=dsj&datafl=%E9%83%BD%E5%B8%82&datadq=&fc=电视剧&datanf=&dataszm=\"target=\"_blank\">都市</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t  </li>\r\n\t\t\t  <li class=\"end2\">\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"common\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/09/28/VIDErFnBWn4Nn0OC6k12PbR7260928.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/8/1791423946190_117.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/09/28/VIDErFnBWn4Nn0OC6k12PbR7260928.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《爱在山海间》</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"hover\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p2.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/8/1791424397432_924.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/09/28/VIDErFnBWn4Nn0OC6k12PbR7260928.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/09/28/VIDErFnBWn4Nn0OC6k12PbR7260928.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《爱在山海间》</a></h3>\r\n\t\t\t                  <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/09/28/VIDErFnBWn4Nn0OC6k12PbR7260928.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">援藏扶贫干部扎根高原，帮助藏区脱贫并发展藏药、藏文化产业。</a></span>\r\n\t\t\t                  <div class=\"label\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.E3alv6pYzpwM.2#datacid=dsj&datafl=%E5%86%9C%E6%9D%91&datadq=&fc=%E7%94%B5%E8%A7%86%E5%89%A7&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">农村</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t      </div>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.E3alv6pYzpwM.2#datacid=dsj&datafl=%E5%86%9C%E6%9D%91&datadq=&fc=%E7%94%B5%E8%A7%86%E5%89%A7&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">农村</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t  </li>\r\n\t\t\t  <li class=\"end1\">\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"common\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2025/12/17/VIDEbDPd6EOXF41aen4v0euI251217.shtml?spm=C55853485115.Pksu4M25z4Dl.0.0\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2025/12/8/1765173889587_840.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2025/12/17/VIDEbDPd6EOXF41aen4v0euI251217.shtml?spm=C55853485115.Pksu4M25z4Dl.0.0\" target=\"_blank\">《乌蒙深处》</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"hover\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2025/11/13/1763014158460_229.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2025/12/17/VIDEbDPd6EOXF41aen4v0euI251217.shtml?spm=C55853485115.Pksu4M25z4Dl.0.0\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2025/12/17/VIDEbDPd6EOXF41aen4v0euI251217.shtml?spm=C55853485115.Pksu4M25z4Dl.0.0\" target=\"_blank\">《乌蒙深处》</a></h3>\r\n\t\t\t                  <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2025/12/17/VIDEbDPd6EOXF41aen4v0euI251217.shtml?spm=C55853485115.Pksu4M25z4Dl.0.0\" target=\"_blank\">讲述新一代青年在悬崖村推动一产、二产、三产融合发展，助力美丽乡村建设的奋斗历程。</a></span>\r\n\t\t\t                  <div class=\"label\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.E3alv6pYzpwM.2#datacid=dsj&datafl=%E5%86%9C%E6%9D%91&datadq=&fc=%E7%94%B5%E8%A7%86%E5%89%A7&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">农村</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t      </div>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.E3alv6pYzpwM.2#datacid=dsj&datafl=%E5%86%9C%E6%9D%91&datadq=&fc=%E7%94%B5%E8%A7%86%E5%89%A7&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">农村</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t  </li>\r\n              \r\n          </ul>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"cont\">\r\n          <ul>\r\n              \r\n              <li>\r\n                  <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n                      <div class=\"common\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2024/08/03/VIDE3aQCO5rF65dg2tonj8GC240803.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2024/10/21/1729492192834_73.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2024/08/03/VIDE3aQCO5rF65dg2tonj8GC240803.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《开心超人联盟》</a></div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <div class=\"hover\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2024/8/16/1723779523807_65.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2024/08/03/VIDE3aQCO5rF65dg2tonj8GC240803.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\">\r\n                              <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2024/08/03/VIDE3aQCO5rF65dg2tonj8GC240803.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《开心超人联盟》</a></h3>\r\n                              <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2024/08/03/VIDE3aQCO5rF65dg2tonj8GC240803.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">五超人和伽罗前去拯救被黑煞统治的平行时空的星星球，一起踏上了寻找开天辟地斧的冒险之旅。</a></span>\r\n                              <div class=\"label\"><a href=\"http://tv.cctv.com/yxg/?spm=C28340.PNiTV80kXvVM.E2PQtIunpEaz.68#datacid=dhp&datafl=%E5%86%92%E9%99%A9&datadq=&fc=动画片&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">冒险</a></div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a href=\"http://tv.cctv.com/yxg/?spm=C28340.PNiTV80kXvVM.E2PQtIunpEaz.68#datacid=dhp&datafl=%E5%86%92%E9%99%A9&datadq=&fc=动画片&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">冒险</a></div>\r\n              </li>\r\n\t\t\t  <li>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"common\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2024/06/09/VIDEQdHW7L56hnsSuiOvpxYs240609.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p4.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2024/6/14/1718338179842_408.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2024/06/09/VIDEQdHW7L56hnsSuiOvpxYs240609.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《卡卡虎大冒险3》</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"hover\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2024/6/14/1718338136363_815.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2024/06/09/VIDEQdHW7L56hnsSuiOvpxYs240609.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2024/06/09/VIDEQdHW7L56hnsSuiOvpxYs240609.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《卡卡虎大冒险3》</a></h3>\r\n\t\t\t                  <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2024/06/09/VIDEQdHW7L56hnsSuiOvpxYs240609.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">卡卡和琦琦是智慧和力量的代表，他们致力于保卫神奇星，击退银河盗猎团，解决神奇星伙伴的问题和困难。</a></span>\r\n\t\t\t                  <div class=\"label\"><a href=\"http://tv.cctv.com/yxg/?spm=C28340.PNiTV80kXvVM.E2PQtIunpEaz.68#datacid=dhp&datafl=%E5%86%92%E9%99%A9&datadq=&fc=动画片&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">冒险</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t      </div>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a href=\"http://tv.cctv.com/yxg/?spm=C28340.PNiTV80kXvVM.E2PQtIunpEaz.68#datacid=dhp&datafl=%E5%86%92%E9%99%A9&datadq=&fc=动画片&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">冒险</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t  </li>\r\n\t\t\t  <li>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"common\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/04/VIDEBVOjJjbLzsoxMiFdMGQW261004.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/19/1792389500967_313.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/04/VIDEBVOjJjbLzsoxMiFdMGQW261004.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《汤姆猫超能战队》</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"hover\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/19/1792389392963_217.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/04/VIDEBVOjJjbLzsoxMiFdMGQW261004.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/04/VIDEBVOjJjbLzsoxMiFdMGQW261004.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《汤姆猫超能战队》</a></h3>\r\n\t\t\t                  <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/04/VIDEBVOjJjbLzsoxMiFdMGQW261004.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">讲述了一支拥有超能力的超能战队在解决危机的同时，也经历了内部的矛盾和成长。</a></span>\r\n\t\t\t                  <div class=\"label\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.E3alv6pYzpwM.6#datacid=dhp&datafl=%E5%86%92%E9%99%A9&datadq=&fc=动画片&dataszm=\"target=\"_blank\">冒险</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t      </div>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.E3alv6pYzpwM.6#datacid=dhp&datafl=%E5%86%92%E9%99%A9&datadq=&fc=动画片&dataszm=\"target=\"_blank\">冒险</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t  </li>\r\n\t\t\t  <li>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"common\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/01/VIDE7OrZTMj932gV3gniNzEv261001.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/16/1792134511557_74.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/01/VIDE7OrZTMj932gV3gniNzEv261001.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《无敌鹿战队冰封计划》</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"hover\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p2.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/16/1792134697477_603.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/01/VIDE7OrZTMj932gV3gniNzEv261001.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/01/VIDE7OrZTMj932gV3gniNzEv261001.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《无敌鹿战队冰封计划》</a></h3>\r\n\t\t\t                  <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/01/VIDE7OrZTMj932gV3gniNzEv261001.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">四只小鹿在闪亮岛地下洞穴意外解冻冰陨石，释放外星恐龙冰龙霸。鹿战队通过团队协作化解危机。</a></span>\r\n\t\t\t                  <div class=\"label\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.E3alv6pYzpwM.6#datacid=dhp&datafl=%E5%86%92%E9%99%A9&datadq=&fc=动画片&dataszm=\"target=\"_blank\">冒险</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t      </div>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.E3alv6pYzpwM.6#datacid=dhp&datafl=%E5%86%92%E9%99%A9&datadq=&fc=动画片&dataszm=\"target=\"_blank\">冒险</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t  </li>\r\n\t\t\t  <li>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"common\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/03/27/VIDEHGpvqAVbzO23fh3NtJtm260327.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p2.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/4/2/1775093273467_20.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/03/27/VIDEHGpvqAVbzO23fh3NtJtm260327.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《布鲁伊》第一季</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"hover\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/4/2/1775093501539_495.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/03/27/VIDEHGpvqAVbzO23fh3NtJtm260327.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/03/27/VIDEHGpvqAVbzO23fh3NtJtm260327.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《布鲁伊》第一季</a></h3>\r\n\t\t\t                  <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/03/27/VIDEHGpvqAVbzO23fh3NtJtm260327.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">澳大利亚牧牛犬布鲁伊有着无穷无尽的想象力，热衷于将日常生活转变为调皮冒险。</a></span>\r\n\t\t\t                  <div class=\"label\"><a  href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/?spm=C96370.PPDB2vhvSivD.EDB1jFexOIP1.104#datacid=dhp&datafl=%E4%BA%B2%E5%AD%90&datadq=&fc=%E5%8A%A8%E7%94%BB%E7%89%87&dataszm=\"_blank\">亲子</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t      </div>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a  href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/?spm=C96370.PPDB2vhvSivD.EDB1jFexOIP1.104#datacid=dhp&datafl=%E4%BA%B2%E5%AD%90&datadq=&fc=%E5%8A%A8%E7%94%BB%E7%89%87&dataszm=\"_blank\">亲子</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t  </li>\r\n\t\t\t  <li class=\"end3\">\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"common\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2025/01/01/VIDEcPPNx21TXZXmIrJi63ft250101.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p4.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2025/1/8/1736306273981_306.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2025/01/01/VIDEcPPNx21TXZXmIrJi63ft250101.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《猪猪侠 恐龙日记7》</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"hover\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p5.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2025/1/8/1736306165960_895.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2025/01/01/VIDEcPPNx21TXZXmIrJi63ft250101.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2025/01/01/VIDEcPPNx21TXZXmIrJi63ft250101.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《猪猪侠 恐龙日记7》</a></h3>\r\n\t\t\t                  <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2025/01/01/VIDEcPPNx21TXZXmIrJi63ft250101.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">讲述了因恐龙星面临着即将被毁灭的危机，猪猪侠和他的同伴为把恐龙转移到方舟而努力的故事。</a></span>\r\n\t\t\t                  <div class=\"label\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C55899450127.PcC8VPp6N7Qa.0.0#datacid=dhp&datafl=%E5%86%92%E9%99%A9&datadq=&fc=%E5%8A%A8%E7%94%BB%E7%89%87&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">冒险</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t      </div>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C55899450127.PcC8VPp6N7Qa.0.0#datacid=dhp&datafl=%E5%86%92%E9%99%A9&datadq=&fc=%E5%8A%A8%E7%94%BB%E7%89%87&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">冒险</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t  </li>\r\n\t\t\t  <li class=\"end2\">\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"common\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/02/20/VIDE3YOTjHAHSVUQ9K5av3A2260220.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/4/14/1776144341268_138.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/02/20/VIDE3YOTjHAHSVUQ9K5av3A2260220.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《新巴巴爸爸》</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"hover\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p4.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/4/14/1776144422985_226.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/02/20/VIDE3YOTjHAHSVUQ9K5av3A2260220.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/02/20/VIDE3YOTjHAHSVUQ9K5av3A2260220.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《新巴巴爸爸》</a></h3>\r\n\t\t\t                  <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/02/20/VIDE3YOTjHAHSVUQ9K5av3A2260220.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">巴巴爸爸的世界变化无穷，充满想象，正如儿童无所不能的想象力，带给孩子们无尽的快乐。</a></span>\r\n\t\t\t                  <div class=\"label\"><a  href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.E3alv6pYzpwM.4#datacid=dhp&datafl=%E4%BA%B2%E5%AD%90&datadq=&fc=%E5%8A%A8%E7%94%BB%E7%89%87&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">亲子</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t      </div>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a  href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.E3alv6pYzpwM.4#datacid=dhp&datafl=%E4%BA%B2%E5%AD%90&datadq=&fc=%E5%8A%A8%E7%94%BB%E7%89%87&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">亲子</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t  </li>\r\n\t\t\t  <li class=\"end1\">\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"common\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/06/24/VIDECXB104out8wWbZBRUAwy260624.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p4.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/7/21/1784616405534_406.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/06/24/VIDECXB104out8wWbZBRUAwy260624.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《小小围棋少年》</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t          <div class=\"hover\">\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/7/21/1784616862089_854.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/06/24/VIDECXB104out8wWbZBRUAwy260624.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t              <div class=\"text\">\r\n\t\t\t                  <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/06/24/VIDECXB104out8wWbZBRUAwy260624.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《小小围棋少年》</a></h3>\r\n\t\t\t                  <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/06/24/VIDECXB104out8wWbZBRUAwy260624.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">历经重重磨难后，围棋天才少年江流儿踏上一段充满挑战和冒险的旅程。</a></span>\r\n\t\t\t                  <div class=\"label\"><a  href=\"http://tv.cctv.com/yxg/?spm=C28340.P9dhkRStLqPh.EYq0LGFLODJm.71#datacid=dhp&datafl=%E7%9B%8A%E6%99%BA&datadq=&fc=%E5%8A%A8%E7%94%BB%E7%89%87&dataszm=\"target=\"_blank\">益智</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t              </div>\r\n\t\t\t          </div>\r\n\t\t\t      </div>\r\n\t\t\t      <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a  href=\"http://tv.cctv.com/yxg/?spm=C28340.P9dhkRStLqPh.EYq0LGFLODJm.71#datacid=dhp&datafl=%E7%9B%8A%E6%99%BA&datadq=&fc=%E5%8A%A8%E7%94%BB%E7%89%87&dataszm=\"target=\"_blank\">益智</a></div>\r\n\t\t\t  </li>\r\n              \r\n          </ul>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"cont\">\r\n          <ul>\r\n              \r\n              <li>\r\n                  <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n                      <div class=\"common\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/06/VIDEKtiqU3nrknFG3Z18mDjZ261006.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/21/1792562322972_313.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/06/VIDEKtiqU3nrknFG3Z18mDjZ261006.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《缅北电诈覆灭纪实》</a></div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <div class=\"hover\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/21/1792562260598_1.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/06/VIDEKtiqU3nrknFG3Z18mDjZ261006.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\">\r\n                              <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/06/VIDEKtiqU3nrknFG3Z18mDjZ261006.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《缅北电诈覆灭纪实》</a></h3>\r\n                              <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/06/VIDEKtiqU3nrknFG3Z18mDjZ261006.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">展现中国公安机关会同有关部门打击缅北涉中犯罪专项工作，彻底铲除缅北“四大家族”等犯罪集团的历程和成效。</a></span>\r\n                              <div class=\"label\"><a  href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C55853485115.PbyFRuU7DWZS.0.0#datacid=jlp&datapd=&datafl=社会&fc=纪录片&datanf=&dataszm=\"target=\"_blank\">社会</a></div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a  href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C55853485115.PbyFRuU7DWZS.0.0#datacid=jlp&datapd=&datafl=社会&fc=纪录片&datanf=&dataszm=\"target=\"_blank\">社会</a></div>\r\n              </li>\r\n              <li>\r\n                  <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n                      <div class=\"common\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/16/VIDEAJYNOxcdcHNI8Jpis7EO261016.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/20/1792477419881_869.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/16/VIDEAJYNOxcdcHNI8Jpis7EO261016.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《广济沧海》</a></div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <div class=\"hover\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/20/1792477386017_835.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/16/VIDEAJYNOxcdcHNI8Jpis7EO261016.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\">\r\n                              <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/16/VIDEAJYNOxcdcHNI8Jpis7EO261016.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《广济沧海》</a></h3>\r\n                              <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/16/VIDEAJYNOxcdcHNI8Jpis7EO261016.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">以广东千年外贸史为线索，上溯汉唐，下至当代，展现中国开放包容、兼济天下的文明特质。</a></span>\r\n                              <div class=\"label\"><a  href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.ELqI6BbwTMR4.4#datacid=jlp&datapd=&datafl=%E4%BA%BA%E6%96%87%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2&fc=%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95%E7%89%87&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">人文历史</a></div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a  href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.ELqI6BbwTMR4.4#datacid=jlp&datapd=&datafl=%E4%BA%BA%E6%96%87%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2&fc=%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95%E7%89%87&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">人文历史</a></div>\r\n              </li>\r\n              <li>\r\n                  <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n                      <div class=\"common\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/18/VIDEo5nZWDjE3qiC4tXRY4Wy261018.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p2.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/19/1792389958393_399.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/18/VIDEo5nZWDjE3qiC4tXRY4Wy261018.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《铁血忠魂》</a></div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <div class=\"hover\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/19/1792389674283_365.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/18/VIDEo5nZWDjE3qiC4tXRY4Wy261018.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\">\r\n                              <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/18/VIDEo5nZWDjE3qiC4tXRY4Wy261018.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《铁血忠魂》</a></h3>\r\n                              <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/18/VIDEo5nZWDjE3qiC4tXRY4Wy261018.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">首次以真实、立体、全景的视角再现红二十五军长征史诗，以此传递跨越时空的信仰力量。</a></span>\r\n                              <div class=\"label\"><a  href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.ELqI6BbwTMR4.4#datacid=jlp&datapd=&datafl=%E4%BA%BA%E6%96%87%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2&fc=%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95%E7%89%87&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">人文历史</a></div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a  href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.ELqI6BbwTMR4.4#datacid=jlp&datapd=&datafl=%E4%BA%BA%E6%96%87%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2&fc=%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95%E7%89%87&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">人文历史</a></div>\r\n              </li>\r\n              <li>\r\n                  <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n                      <div class=\"common\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/15/VIDEYAhd6H6YKxbDrsoCDlOO261015.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p2.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/16/1792134900872_558.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/15/VIDEYAhd6H6YKxbDrsoCDlOO261015.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《伟大远征》</a></div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <div class=\"hover\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p2.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/16/1792135020974_545.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/15/VIDEYAhd6H6YKxbDrsoCDlOO261015.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\">\r\n                              <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/15/VIDEYAhd6H6YKxbDrsoCDlOO261015.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《伟大远征》</a></h3>\r\n                              <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/15/VIDEYAhd6H6YKxbDrsoCDlOO261015.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">呈现中国共产党领导红军进行伟大长征的光辉历程，反映胜利完成震撼世界、彪炳史册的长征的伟大意义。</a></span>\r\n                              <div class=\"label\"><a  href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.ELqI6BbwTMR4.4#datacid=jlp&datapd=&datafl=%E4%BA%BA%E6%96%87%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2&fc=%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95%E7%89%87&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">人文历史</a></div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a  href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.ELqI6BbwTMR4.4#datacid=jlp&datapd=&datafl=%E4%BA%BA%E6%96%87%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2&fc=%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95%E7%89%87&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">人文历史</a></div>\r\n              </li>\r\n              <li>\r\n                  <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n                      <div class=\"common\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/12/VIDEogyxbNAmX8wflHuYKJrf261012.shtml?spm=C55924871139.PY8jbb3G6NT9.0.0\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p5.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/15/1792048593925_75.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/12/VIDEogyxbNAmX8wflHuYKJrf261012.shtml?spm=C55924871139.PY8jbb3G6NT9.0.0\" target=\"_blank\">《万水千山》</a></div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <div class=\"hover\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p2.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/15/1792048629625_373.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/12/VIDEogyxbNAmX8wflHuYKJrf261012.shtml?spm=C55924871139.PY8jbb3G6NT9.0.0\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\">\r\n                              <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/12/VIDEogyxbNAmX8wflHuYKJrf261012.shtml?spm=C55924871139.PY8jbb3G6NT9.0.0\" target=\"_blank\">《万水千山》</a></h3>\r\n                              <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/12/VIDEogyxbNAmX8wflHuYKJrf261012.shtml?spm=C55924871139.PY8jbb3G6NT9.0.0\" target=\"_blank\">全景呈现长征的光辉历程，解读长征胜利的历史内涵和时代意义。</a></span>\r\n                              <div class=\"label\"><a  href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.ELqI6BbwTMR4.4#datacid=jlp&datapd=&datafl=%E4%BA%BA%E6%96%87%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2&fc=%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95%E7%89%87&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">人文历史</a></div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a  href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.ELqI6BbwTMR4.4#datacid=jlp&datapd=&datafl=%E4%BA%BA%E6%96%87%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2&fc=%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95%E7%89%87&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">人文历史</a></div>\r\n              </li>\r\n              <li class=\"end3\">\r\n                  <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n                      <div class=\"common\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/01/VIDE1bY4tA9rs9DkqJ6VMHJz261001.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p1.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/13/1791876831880_880.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/01/VIDE1bY4tA9rs9DkqJ6VMHJz261001.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《开始提问吧》</a></div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <div class=\"hover\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p5.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/13/1791876944271_91.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/01/VIDE1bY4tA9rs9DkqJ6VMHJz261001.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\">\r\n                              <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/01/VIDE1bY4tA9rs9DkqJ6VMHJz261001.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《开始提问吧》</a></h3>\r\n                              <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/01/VIDE1bY4tA9rs9DkqJ6VMHJz261001.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">探寻独属于中国的风格，并向人们介绍那些“中国 STYLE”——我们曾经的生活，我们正在进行的生活。</a></span>\r\n                              <div class=\"label\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.E3alv6pYzpwM.2#datacid=jlp&datapd=&datafl=%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A&fc=%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95%E7%89%87&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">社会</a></div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.E3alv6pYzpwM.2#datacid=jlp&datapd=&datafl=%E7%A4%BE%E4%BC%9A&fc=%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95%E7%89%87&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">社会</a></div>\r\n              </li>\r\n              <li class=\"end2\">\r\n                  <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n                      <div class=\"common\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/08/18/VIDEdtYDBXYmfcwVaAoOvVd7260818.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/8/19/1787121485080_640.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/08/18/VIDEdtYDBXYmfcwVaAoOvVd7260818.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《天下昆仑》</a></div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <div class=\"hover\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p4.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/8/19/1787121444632_603.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/08/18/VIDEdtYDBXYmfcwVaAoOvVd7260818.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\">\r\n                              <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/08/18/VIDEdtYDBXYmfcwVaAoOvVd7260818.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《天下昆仑》</a></h3>\r\n                              <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/08/18/VIDEdtYDBXYmfcwVaAoOvVd7260818.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">从神话昆仑，到文化昆仑，再到地理昆仑，讲述昆仑文化的历史源流、精神内涵与当代价值。</a></span>\r\n                              <div class=\"label\"><a  href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.ELqI6BbwTMR4.4#datacid=jlp&datapd=&datafl=%E4%BA%BA%E6%96%87%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2&fc=%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95%E7%89%87&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">人文历史</a></div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a  href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.ELqI6BbwTMR4.4#datacid=jlp&datapd=&datafl=%E4%BA%BA%E6%96%87%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2&fc=%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95%E7%89%87&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">人文历史</a></div>\r\n              </li>\r\n              <li class=\"end1\">\r\n                  <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n                      <div class=\"common\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/09/28/VIDE4QHaqLUXlZuW8rE1rB1q260928.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/8/1791432400463_852.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/09/28/VIDE4QHaqLUXlZuW8rE1rB1q260928.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《栗毓美》</a></div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <div class=\"hover\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/8/1791432651467_422.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/09/28/VIDE4QHaqLUXlZuW8rE1rB1q260928.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\">\r\n                              <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/09/28/VIDE4QHaqLUXlZuW8rE1rB1q260928.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《栗毓美》</a></h3>\r\n                              <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/09/28/VIDE4QHaqLUXlZuW8rE1rB1q260928.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">讲述清代道光年间河东河道总督栗毓美临危受命、治理黄河的传奇人生。</a></span>\r\n                              <div class=\"label\"><a  href=\"http://tv.cctv.com/yxg/?spm=C55953877151.PHXsiQANZko2.0.0#datacid=jlp&datapd=&datafl=%E4%BA%BA%E7%89%A9&fc=%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95%E7%89%87&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">人物</a></div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a  href=\"http://tv.cctv.com/yxg/?spm=C55953877151.PHXsiQANZko2.0.0#datacid=jlp&datapd=&datafl=%E4%BA%BA%E7%89%A9&fc=%E7%BA%AA%E5%BD%95%E7%89%87&datanf=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">人物</a></div>\r\n              </li>\r\n              \r\n          </ul>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"cont\">\r\n          <ul>\r\n              \r\n              <li>\r\n                  <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n                      <div class=\"common\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/10/VIDEmkiBhJp94LbvgDYWNFfW261010.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p5.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/21/1792562504190_896.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/10/VIDEmkiBhJp94LbvgDYWNFfW261010.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《舆图探山河》</a></div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <div class=\"hover\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p4.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/21/1792562471297_11.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/10/VIDEmkiBhJp94LbvgDYWNFfW261010.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\">\r\n                              <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/10/VIDEmkiBhJp94LbvgDYWNFfW261010.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《舆图探山河》</a></h3>\r\n                              <span><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/10/VIDEmkiBhJp94LbvgDYWNFfW261010.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">系统讲述中国古代重大公共建设的历史文化价值，也从水利、商贸与城市兴衰中，梳理中国经济地理的历史脉络。</a></span>\r\n                              <div class=\"label\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.E3alv6pYzpwM.8#datacid=tbjm&datapd=&datafl=%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96&fc=%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E8%8A%82%E7%9B%AE&datajr=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">文化</a></div>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"typeLabel\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/yxg/index.shtml?spm=C28340.PdNvWY0LYxCP.E3alv6pYzpwM.8#datacid=tbjm&datapd=&datafl=%E6%96%87%E5%8C%96&fc=%E7%89%B9%E5%88%AB%E8%8A%82%E7%9B%AE&datajr=&dataszm=\" target=\"_blank\">文化</a></div>\r\n              </li>\r\n              <li>\r\n                  <div class=\"conTop\">\r\n                      <div class=\"common\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/18/VIDECPfWqgMVVOrzK67Jw1jH261018.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" class=\"lazy\" data-echo=\"//p2.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/20/1792477654751_114.jpg\" /><em class=\"\"></em></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\"><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/18/VIDECPfWqgMVVOrzK67Jw1jH261018.shtml\" target=\"_blank\">《英雄的史诗》</a></div>\r\n                      </div>\r\n                      <div class=\"hover\">\r\n                          <div class=\"img\" data-img=\"//p5.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/page/performance/img/2026/10/20/1792477612108_47.gif\" data-src=\"\">\r\n                              <a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/18/VIDECPfWqgMVVOrzK67Jw1jH261018.shtml\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"//p3.img.cctvpic.com/photoAlbum/templet/common/DEPA1628231077516717/zwPic1_1.gif\" /></a>\r\n                          </div>\r\n                          <div class=\"text\">\r\n                              <h3><a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2026/10/18/VIDECPfWqgMVVOrzK